    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056520/extras/492908d00aebb4e2b13dea2806304f2d.poster.avif?t=1753789943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056520/extras/492908d00aebb4e2b13dea2806304f2d.webm?t=1753789943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056520/extras/492908d00aebb4e2b13dea2806304f2d.mp4?t=1753789943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slay hordes of moon horrors and survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moonbane Survivor</i> is a roguelite RPG bullet hell set in a city ravaged by the moon's mysterious influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, collect loot, craft your build, and grow stronger. Fight to reclaim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience the thrill of weaving through bullet storms with unique combinations of weapon modules and gear!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate relentless swarms of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect loot and equip new gear to get stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine various weapon modules to create your own powerful arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer stages to unlock new weapons and modules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056520/extras/492908d00aebb4e2b13dea2806304f2d.poster.avif?t=1753789943\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056520/extras/492908d00aebb4e2b13dea2806304f2d.webm?t=1753789943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056520/extras/492908d00aebb4e2b13dea2806304f2d.mp4?t=1753789943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slay hordes of moon horrors and survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moonbane Survivor</i> is a roguelite RPG bullet hell set in a city ravaged by the moon's mysterious influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, collect loot, craft your build, and grow stronger. Fight to reclaim the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Experience the thrill of weaving through bullet storms with unique combinations of weapon modules and gear!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate relentless swarms of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect loot and equip new gear to get stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine various weapon modules to create your own powerful arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer stages to unlock new weapons and modules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
